WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.268
-And now,
President Donald Trump.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:08.574
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you.

00:00:08.574 --> 00:00:11.010
Thank me. Thank me very much.

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:15.915
You're all very happy that
I'm here at the United Nations.

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.016
I mean, wow.

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.284
Just look at all of
the room full of

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.387
diverse cultures
and ethnicities.

00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:23.255
Seriously, it's like
the scariest college brochure

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:26.092
I've ever seen.

00:00:26.092 --> 00:00:27.327
But I know what
you're all thinking --

00:00:27.327 --> 00:00:29.329
it's so great to be here with me

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:34.467
for the last 4 to 6 hours
of my presidency.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.835
Who knew?

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.571
You make one phone call
blackmailing a foreign leader,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.439
and everyone acts like you

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:45.277
made one phone call
blackmailing a foreign leader.

00:00:45.277 --> 00:00:46.613
I guess it's like
the old saying.

00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:48.447
Collude once, shame on you.

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:52.986
Collude twice,
why not collude a third time?

00:00:52.986 --> 00:00:56.722
But now it looks like
my whistle's been blown,

00:00:56.722 --> 00:01:00.994
and not in the good way.

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:02.428
It was a low-down blow-down.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:05.532
And now I'll have to
face off against America's

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:08.501
least-fun grandma, Nancy Pelosi.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:12.071
That's right -- Nancy's gone
totally Ukraine in the membrane.

00:01:12.071 --> 00:01:16.509
But, luckily, she has
no evidence against me --

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:19.078
only calls and transcripts
and the fist pump

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:20.879
I just gave the Ukrainian
president on my way up here.

00:01:20.879 --> 00:01:23.149
Hey, what's up, buddy?

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:25.551
But unfairly for me,
Ukraine isn't my only

00:01:25.551 --> 00:01:27.620
big no-no this week.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.221
Apparently, people are still mad
because I left

00:01:29.221 --> 00:01:32.592
yesterday's climate summit after
just 15 minutes.

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:35.462
But, honestly, folks,
how do you expect me to believe

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.363
in global warming
when they just filmed

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:39.833
the second "Frozen" movie?

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:44.471
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:55.315
I mean, seriously, let it go.

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:57.583
But, anyway, back to
"The Witch Hunt: Season 3."

00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:59.886
I just want to --
All my supporters --

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:01.687
I want them all
to just relax, okay?

00:02:01.687 --> 00:02:04.157
Because as hard as people
try to impeach me,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.092
I'll always be
one step ahead of them,

00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.062
trying to impeach me harder.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:12.598
But, anyway, in collusion...

00:02:12.598 --> 00:02:14.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:23.509
...America's the
greatest country on Earth,

00:02:23.509 --> 00:02:27.079
Ukraine owes me a serious fave,

00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:28.547
and you might call it
climate change,

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:30.216
but I call it Hot Girl Summer.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:32.451
Oh, and one more thing.

00:02:32.451 --> 00:02:35.388
"The Tonight Show" is coming to
you live from New York City!

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.123
Let's start the show, baby!
Come on!

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:38.258
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

